OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny lingering rain soon
OL,6,Fclearing to the southeast after dawn.
OL,7,FThen mostly dry with bright or sunny
OL,8,Fspells breaking through and a few
OL,9,Fshowers possible in the west. Light
OL,10,Fwinds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStaying mostly dry through
OL,13,Fthe evening and overnight, though the
OL,14,Fodd shower is possible in the west.
OL,15,FVariable cloud with clear spells,
OL,16,Fespecially in east, leading to a
OL,17,Fchilly night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
