OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FBright or sunny spells through
OL,6,Fthe day and staying mostly dry with
OL,7,Fjust the odd shower possible, these
OL,8,Fmost likely in the west.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FLargely
OL,11,Fdry and settled over the next few days
OL,12,Fwith cloud at times but some long
OL,13,Fspells of sunshine on offer. Chillier
OL,14,Fnights than of late.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
